OL,3,GNEWSAChildren and passengers escape
OL,4,Ainjury after 'reckless' attack on bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Ffollowing an attack on a bus in the
OL,8,FLecky Road area of Londonderry.
OL,10,FThe incident occurred around 18:25 BST.
OL,11,FPolice are reporting that missiles were
OL,12,Fthrown at a bus by a number of youths.
OL,14,FChief Superintendent Gillian Kearney
OL,15,Fsaid: "Damage was caused to five
OL,16,Fwindows, including the front window of
OL,17,Fthe bus following the incident.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
