OL,3,GNEWSAChildren and passengers escape
OL,4,Ainjury after 'reckless' attack on bus
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A number of passengers, including two
OL,7,Fchildren were on board and although not
OL,8,Finjured, the passengers and driver were
OL,9,Fleft badly shaken. A number of items
OL,10,Fhad also been set alight on the road
OL,11,Fwhich have now been extinguished.
